    "text": "WITN\nwebsite\nJacksonville\nOnslow Community Outreach opens cooling shelter due to high temperatures\nBy Olivia Dols,4 hours ago\nJACKSONVILLE, N.C. (WITN) - Onslow Community Outreach opened a cooling shelter for the second day on Wednesday for people to get a break from the heat. Temperatures across the east reached the upper 90s with the heat index in the triple digits. The shelter opens its door when temperatures reach 92 degrees or there is an extreme weather condition.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
